  "weighted_iv_per_adr_usd": 13.44,
  "street_weighted_iv_per_adr_usd": 13.85,
  "band_position": null,
  "band_position_note": "Set to null deliberately. The house/street band is EUR1,152.69-EUR1,188.04, a spread of only 3.1%, because Adyen's SBC is 1.85% of net revenue rather than the 10-15% typical of US tech. The current price of EUR1,079.60 sits BELOW both bounds, so a band position would compute to roughly -207% -- a degenerate figure that says nothing useful. The finding is the narrowness itself: for Adyen the SBC accounting regime is almost irrelevant to the valuation, unlike a heavy issuer where it is most of the market cap."
